# WebSystem RC1 — Hostinger Mail (configuration only)
# Copy these keys to a server-side secrets file outside Git; never commit real values.
# Set on KVM2 before deploying this branch:
APP_ORIGIN=https://unlockertools.tech
COOKIE_SECURE=true
SMTP_HOST=smtp.hostinger.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=admin@unlockertools.tech
SMTP_PASS=REPLACE_WITH_HOSTINGER_MAILBOX_PASSWORD
MAIL_FROM="WebSystem UNLOCKER Tools <admin@unlockertools.tech>"

# Hostinger Email account is active, but its trial expires on 2026-12-09.
# Verify Hostinger's current SMTP hostname and limits in hPanel.
# Ensure SPF/DKIM/DMARC and MX remain correct; never replace MX with the VPS IP.
# The outbox does not send automatically; admin triggers /api/admin/client-area/mail/send-pending.
# Do not put passwords in chat, GitHub, command history or world-readable compose files.
